-giles-1-2\">\n<div class=\"event-summary\">\n\t<h1>Winter by the River 2025 - Supporting St Giles Trust</h1>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p><img src=\"https://www.londonbridgecity.co.uk/uploads/_640x480_crop_center-center_none/St-Giles.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>We're excited to be supporting St Giles Trust again this Winter by the River.</p>\n\t<p></p>\n</div>\n</a>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-6 event\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-3 do-not-alter-height\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"multi-day square-me\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"day\">13</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"month\">Nov</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"month\">Jan</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"day\">04</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.londonbridgecity.co.uk/events/2025/november/winter-by-the-river-2025-choir-schedule-2\">\n<div class=\"event-summary\">\n\t<h1>Winter by the River 2025 - Choir Schedule</h1>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p><img src=\"https://www.londonbridgecity.co.uk/uploads/_640x480_crop_center-center_none/4.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Jingle all the way to our wonderful choirs performing during Winter by the River!</p>\n<p><a1\n\t<p></p>\n</div>\n</a>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-6 event\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-3 do-not-alter-height\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"multi-day square-me\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"day\">11</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"month\">Nov</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"month\">Jan</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"day\">04</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</d